  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>求 <span class=\"katex math inline\">x</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">p</span></sup> <span class=\"katex math inline\">mod</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">m</span> 的值。（<span class=\"katex math inline\">mod</span> 代表取余数）  </p>\n<p>提示：若 <span class=\"katex math inline\">p</span> 为偶数，<span class=\"katex math inline\">x</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">p</span></sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">=</span>(<span class=\"katex math inline\">x</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">p/2</span></sup>)<sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span></sup>；若 <span class=\"katex math inline\">p</span> 为奇数，<span class=\"katex math inline\">x</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">p</span></sup>=<span class=\"katex math inline\">x</span>*(<span class=\"katex math inline\">x</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">(p-1)/2</span></sup>)<sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span></sup>，该题可以采用分治法求解。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "求 xp mod m 的值。（mod 代表取余数）  \n提示：若 p 为偶数，xp=(xp/2)2；若 p 为奇数，xp=x*(x(p-1)/2)2，该题可以采用分治法求解。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p><span class=\"katex math inline\">x</span>，<span class=\"katex math inline\">p</span> 是不超过 <span class=\"katex math inline\">10</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">9</span></sup> 的非负整数，<span class=\"katex math inline\">m</span> 是不超过 <span class=\"katex math inline\">10</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">9</span></sup> 的正整数。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "x，p 是不超过 109 的非负整数，m 是不超过 109 的正整数。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p><span class=\"katex math inline\">x^p \\mod m</span> 的值。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "x^p \\mod m 的值。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>2 10 100</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>24</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
      "text": "输入\n                            2 10 100\n                        \n                        \n                            输出\n                            24"
    },
